# Mobbin-first UI

Any frontend or UI change (HTML, CSS, workspace layout, dialogs, empty
states, Pages chrome) must cite Mobbin (`mobbin.com`) screen links in the
PRD or slice issue **before** implementation.

- If the PRD or slice has no links, search Mobbin (Mobbin MCP tools when
  available), write the citations into the PRD or slice, then implement.
- If Mobbin is unavailable and no links exist, stop. Do not invent a layout.
- Cite the links in the PR. Attach before/after screenshots.
- Adapt patterns to Codify's existing dark workspace. Do not copy branding.
- Privacy chrome stays as `.cursor/rules/privacy-web.mdc` specifies.
